<view class="dj-page"><view class="dj-title">{{label || '兑换详情'}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="dj-error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{order}}" class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-subtitle">{{order.title}}</view><view>已使用 {{order.cost}} 可用积分</view><view>兑换点：{{order.point_id}}</view><view class="dj-note dj-safe-text">订单 {{order.id}}</view><block wx:if="{{order.status === 'PENDING'}}"><view>订单剩余 {{orderRemaining}}</view><image wx:if="{{qrPath && !codeExpired}}" class="dj-qr" src="{{qrPath}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view wx:if="{{codeExpired}}" class="dj-error">动态码已到期，请刷新。订单未到期前不会因码过期退款。</view><view class="dj-note">动态码剩余 {{codeRemaining}}；默认 5 分钟，订单默认 15 分钟。</view><button bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新兑换码（使旧码失效）</button><button wx:if="{{token}}" class="dj-secondary" bindtap="copy">复制真实测试码</button><button class="dj-secondary" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy}}">取消未领取订单</button></block><view wx:else class="dj-note">状态由服务端确认；核销不再次扣分。</view></view><button class="dj-secondary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新订单状态</button></view>
